  "project_description": "Features \n Paragraphs Sum formatter module provides a formatter that displays the sum of a configurable field on multi-valued paragraphs.\n\n Works with all core numeric fields, with the exception of phone. \n\n Post-Installation \n After installing this module a new formatter for paragraphs will be available \n\n \n Go to the display settings of the content type. \n Select the Paragraphs Sum formatter for the paragraph field. \n Configure the formatter to use the numeric field you want to sum. \n \n Additional Requirements \n Paragraphs \n\n Back to top",
